  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). An obsidian sentinel at the top of the crater path, set there to stop anyone reaching the wyrm. A glass pike cone, a shield bash that throws its target, and lava it kicks over the area that stays. At 60% it calls the rim — vent wisps rise to fight beside it. At 30% it holds the line: a get-in-close ring and four lines of glass.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough at 20. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; wisps 3 -> 4 at five; lava splashes +1 per extra player.",
